    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink the potion and step into the <strong>Domain of Hallucination</strong>, where survival is your only goal. Each run is unique: new maps, unpredictable enemies, and a fresh arsenal of weapons await every time you enter. But beware\u2014the Game Master\u2019s relentless challenges will test your limits over and over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger by engraving yourself with ancient, mystical symbols, unlocking powers to dominate your foes. Escape the hallucination alive, and you\u2019ll be rewarded generously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game combines the intensity of the bullet hell genre with the strategic depth and satisfaction of bullet heaven. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your run you choose your next encounter by placing new map tiles, each with their unique challenges and rewards.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink the potion and step into the <strong>Domain of Hallucination</strong>, where survival is your only goal. Each run is unique: new maps, unpredictable enemies, and a fresh arsenal of weapons await every time you enter. But beware\u2014the Game Master\u2019s relentless challenges will test your limits over and over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger by engraving yourself with ancient, mystical symbols, unlocking powers to dominate your foes. Escape the hallucination alive, and you\u2019ll be rewarded generously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game combines the intensity of the bullet hell genre with the strategic depth and satisfaction of bullet heaven. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your run you choose your next encounter by placing new map tiles, each with their unique challenges and rewards.</p>",
